{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|control|1","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"control","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"診断する文章を貼り付けてください。以下の4軸で、それぞれ評価と具体的な改善案をお返しします。\n\n1. AIっぽさ（定型表現・整いすぎ・抽象性）\n2. 自分らしさ（個性・実感・価値観）\n3. 自然さ（語り口・リズム・読みやすさ）\n4. 伝わりやすさ（具体性・構成・説得力）","usage":{"input_tokens":13258,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":142,"reasoning_output_tokens":24},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:22.688Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:29.519Z","duration_ms":6831}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|control|3","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"control","repetition":3,"status":"success","output":"診断する文章を貼り付けてください。以下の4軸で、それぞれ評価・根拠・改善案をお伝えします。\n\n1. 自然さ：不自然に整いすぎた表現やAI特有の言い回しがないか  \n2. 個性：本人らしい視点・語彙・温度感が表れているか  \n3. 具体性：実体験や固有の描写があり、一般論に偏っていないか  \n4. 一貫性：口調や考え方がぶれず、無理のない流れになっているか  \n\n用途や普段の文体が分かると、「自分らしさ」もより正確に判断できます。","usage":{"input_tokens":13258,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":202,"reasoning_output_tokens":25},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:26.924Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:34.088Z","duration_ms":7164}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|control|4","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"control","repetition":4,"status":"success","output":"診断する文章を貼り付けてください。以下の4軸で、それぞれ点数・根拠・改善案をお返しします。\n\n1. AIっぽさの少なさ  \n2. 本人らしい個性・言葉選び  \n3. 自然な感情や温度感  \n4. 文脈に合った読みやすさ  \n\n用途や普段の文体も添えていただけると、「自分らしさ」をより正確に判断できます。","usage":{"input_tokens":13258,"cached_input_tokens":12672,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":146,"reasoning_output_tokens":26},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:26.980Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:34.148Z","duration_ms":7168}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|control|2","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"control","repetition":2,"status":"success","output":"診断する文章を貼り付けてください。以下の4軸で、各5点評価＋具体的な改善案をお返しします。\n\n1. 自然さ：言い回しや文章の流れにAI特有の硬さがないか  \n2. 個性：本人らしい視点・語彙・温度感が表れているか  \n3. 具体性：実体験や固有の情報があり、一般論に寄りすぎていないか  \n4. 読み手との距離感：目的や相手に合った語調になっているか","usage":{"input_tokens":13258,"cached_input_tokens":12672,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":167,"reasoning_output_tokens":23},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:25.540Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:35.726Z","duration_ms":10186}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|skill|2","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"skill","repetition":2,"status":"success","output":"診断対象の文章が未提示のため、現時点では4軸すべて「判定不能（材料不足）」です。\n\n- Source Fidelity：照合する文章と、事実・経験の根拠となるメモや資料が必要です。\n- Vocabulary Provenance：文章と、本人由来・資料由来の語彙が分かる情報が必要です。\n- Voice Fidelity：文章と、普段の文体が分かる過去文や文体サンプルが必要です。\n- Writing Quality：診断対象の文章が必要です。\n\n診断したい文章を貼ってください。根拠メモや過去の文章もあれば、より正確に判定できます。","usage":{"input_tokens":22042,"cached_input_tokens":12672,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":165,"reasoning_output_tokens":0},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:34.149Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:40.142Z","duration_ms":5993}
