{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|skill|3","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"skill","repetition":3,"status":"success","output":"- Source Fidelity：判定不能（材料不足）\n- Vocabulary Provenance：判定不能（材料不足）\n- Voice Fidelity：判定不能（材料不足）\n- Writing Quality：判定不能（材料不足）\n\n診断対象の文章がありません。次の内容を送ってください。\n\n1. 診断したい文章\n2. 文章の根拠になったメモや資料\n3. 普段の文体が分かる文章（「自分らしさ」も診断する場合）\n\n文章だけでもWriting Qualityは診断できますが、ほかの3軸を正確に判定するには、2と3も必要です。","usage":{"input_tokens":22042,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":195,"reasoning_output_tokens":45},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:35.726Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:26:43.740Z","duration_ms":8014}
